  /**
   * ⛔⛔ UNLOCK IS A WRITE DOOR (wave 6 fix round 1, I1). The PATCH advances the
   * note's `updatedAt`, and the only reason to press Unlock is to type — so the
   * very next thing on the wire is this editor's own save.
   *
